## Coding Guidelines
- Use Clean Architecture: Data → Domain → Presentation layers
- Follow MVVM pattern for ViewModels
- Use @MainActor for ViewModel classes that update UI
- Prefer struct over class where possible
- Use Swift naming conventions: camelCase for properties/methods, PascalCase for types

